## Worksheet

**F1 Core loop** — `newState()` builds one state object; `nextRand(s)` (mulberry32-variant) is the sole RNG, state stored in `s.rngState`; `runTurn()` iterates fixed `TURN_STEPS` array called from `onEndTurn()`. Score 2.

**F2 Map** — `GRID=8`, `genMap()` uses seeded `rnd(s)` for terrain; `canBuild()` checks `bt.terrain.indexOf(tile.t)`; `adjacencyOf()` multiplies output, read in `buildingIO()`. Score 2.

**F3 Economy** — chains ash→soil (Soil Works)→food (Greenhouse), ore→metal→parts; `caps()` enforces storage; `stepCaps()` clamps, logs overflow, tracks `stats.overflowLost`. Score 2.

**F4 Population** — colonist records have `skill,fatigue,morale,job,at`; `workerFactor()` reads `c.skill`/`c.fatigue` and feeds `runBuilding()`. Score 2.

**F5 Needs** — `stepNeeds()` computes per-turn food/water consumption, sets `hungry/thirsty`; `stepMorale()` reduces morale on shortage; `workerFactor()` mf multiplier reduces output; recovery via clinic/food/drift-to-target, not instant loss (`c.zero>=3`). Score 2.

**F6 Research** — 12 nodes in `TECHS`; `techState()` enforces `req`; `doResearch()` deducts cost; effects applied via `techMult`, `inputMult`, `caps()`, `isUnlocked`, `stormMitigation`. Score 2.

**F7 Events** — 14 events; weighted pool selection in `stepEvent()`; 5 events (`wanderers,tunnel,failure,raiders,survey`) have 2-3 branching `run()` effects; `s.events.cd` cooldown. Score 2.

**F8 Trade** — `priceOf()` uses `scarcity(s,k)` (stockpile) and `market.idx` (drift, `driftMarket()`); caravan `inv`/`purse` finite; `doBuy`/`doSell` both validate and mutate. Score 2.

**F9 Hazard** — `stepStorm()` fires every 5 turns from turn 5, severity `1+floor(turn/12)+...`; damages `tile.b.integrity`; `integrityFactor()` cuts output in `buildingIO`; `stormMitigation()` reads windbreaks/tech; `repairCost`/`doRepair` spend parts and restore. Score 2.

**F10 Save/load** — `serialize()` to textarea text; `loadFrom()` JSON.parse + `validateSave()` with specific field-level error strings shown in `S.ui.loadMsg`. Score 2.

**F11 End conditions** — `stepEnd()` checks pop 0 loss and turn 60 `winCheck()`; `scoreOf()` combines population/research/turns/buildings/stockpile/skill; modal in `renderModal()` shows summary. Score 2.

**F12 UI** — `wireAll()`/`TABS` switch views; log entries `"T"+l.turn`; `data-tip` tooltips throughout explaining formulas; keydown handler for Space/1-6; `@media(max-width:700px)` adapts layout. Score 2.

**F13 Dev panel** — `runTests()` 41 assertions on real invariants (no negative resources, cap limits, save/load hash roundtrip, prereqs); `runBenchmark()` runs headless loop via `greedyPolicy`+`runTurn`, prints `stateHash()` in `#runBench` handler. Score 2.

**G1** — `techMult()` reads `s.tech.sifting` etc., multiplies `out.out[k]` in `buildingIO`; test 13 explicitly verifies. Score 4.

**G2** — `stepNeeds` sets `c.hungry/c.thirsty` → `stepMorale` subtracts morale (-13/-15) → `workerFactor` mf multiplier cuts production every turn. Score 4.

**G3** — `stepStorm` cuts `tile.b.integrity` → `integrityFactor` scales `buildingIO` output → `repairCost`/`doRepair` spend parts and restore to 100, visible in tile tooltip/bar. Score 4.

**G4** — `priceOf` reads `scarcity(s,k)` (own stockpile) and `market.idx[k]` (drifted each turn in `stepMarket`→`driftMarket`); test 33 confirms. Score 4.

**G5** — `wanderers`/`tunnel`/`raiders`/`survey` opts each write distinct `s.res`, `s.colonists`, or `s.mods` changes per branch, not just log text. Score 4.

